3) Kazdodenna praca
-------------------
Po prvom spusteni existuje ./vendor/bin/sail (skratka pre "docker compose exec ...").
Volitelne si nastav alias (napr. do ~/.bashrc):

alias sail='sh $([ -f sail ] && echo sail || echo vendor/bin/sail)'

Zapnutie / vypnutie:

./vendor/bin/sail up -d        (alebo: docker compose up -d)
./vendor/bin/sail stop         (alebo: docker compose stop)
./vendor/bin/sail down         (zastavi a odstrani kontajnery, databaza ostane)

Frontend (CSS a JS z resources/):
Prehliadac nenacitava resources/css/app.css priamo, ale zbuildeny subor public/build/.
Zmena v CSS/JS sa preto prejavi az po builde alebo pri beziacom dev serveri.

./vendor/bin/sail npm run build    jednorazovy build (pouzi pred odovzdanim / po zmenach)
./vendor/bin/sail npm run dev      dev server s hot reloadom (zmeny hned), ukoncit Ctrl+C

Dalsie prikazy:

./vendor/bin/sail artisan test             testy (58)
./vendor/bin/sail artisan migrate          nove migracie
./vendor/bin/sail artisan optimize:clear   vycistenie cache (config, routy, views)
./vendor/bin/sail artisan route:list       zoznam rout
./vendor/bin/sail shell                    terminal v kontajneri
./vendor/bin/sail mysql                    MySQL konzola (databaza eshop)

Zmazanie databazy a novy import ukazkovych dat:

./vendor/bin/sail down -v
./vendor/bin/sail up -d


4) Po "git pull" (aktualizacia projektu)
----------------------------------------
./vendor/bin/sail up -d
./vendor/bin/sail composer install         ak sa zmenil composer.lock
./vendor/bin/sail npm ci                   ak sa zmenil package-lock.json
./vendor/bin/sail artisan migrate          ak pribudli migracie
./vendor/bin/sail npm run build
./vendor/bin/sail artisan optimize:clear

Ak sa zmenil priecinok docker/ (Dockerfile, init-app):

docker compose build --no-cache
docker compose up -d


5) Najcastejsie problemy
------------------------
Port 80 je obsadeny ("address already in use", casto Apache alebo nginx na Ubuntu):
  zisti:   sudo ss -ltnp | grep ':80 '
  vypni:   sudo systemctl stop apache2    (alebo nginx)
  alebo v .env nastav APP_PORT=8080 -> web bude na http://localhost:8080

Port 3306 je obsadeny (lokalna MySQL):
  v .env nastav FORWARD_DB_PORT=3307   (aplikacia v kontajneri to nepotrebuje,
  je to len port pre pristup z Ubuntu)

Port 5173 (Vite) je obsadeny (tyka sa len "npm run dev"):
  v .env nastav VITE_PORT=5174, potom: ./vendor/bin/sail up -d
  a dev server spusti na rovnakom porte: ./vendor/bin/sail npm run dev -- --port 5174

"Vite manifest not found at public/build/manifest.json":
  ./vendor/bin/sail npm ci
  ./vendor/bin/sail npm run build

Stranka nema styly / CSS a JS sa nenacitaju (v zdrojovom kode stranky je localhost:5173):
  ostal subor public/hot po prerusenom "npm run dev". Zmaz ho alebo spusti build:
  rm -f public/hot
  ./vendor/bin/sail npm run build

Permission denied (storage, bootstrap/cache, logy, views):
  ./vendor/bin/sail root-shell -c "chown -R sail:sail /var/www/html/storage /var/www/html/bootstrap/cache"
  ./vendor/bin/sail artisan optimize:clear
  (trvale riesenie: WWWUSER/WWWGROUP v .env podla "id -u" a "id -g", pozri krok 1)

Kontajner sa po starte ukonci alebo v logu chyba "[init]":
  docker compose logs laravel.test     (posledny riadok [init] ukaze krok, ktory zlyhal)
  Ak v logu nie je ziadny riadok "[init]", bezi stary image bez skriptu init-app:
  docker compose build --no-cache
  docker compose up -d

Chyba databazy po starte ("Connection refused", "SQLSTATE[HY000] [2002]"):
  MySQL este startuje, pockaj chvilu. Stav: docker compose ps (mysql musi byt "healthy").

Obrazky produktov sa nezobrazuju:
  ./vendor/bin/sail artisan storage:link

Testy hlasia chybajucu databazu "testing":
  databaza sa vytvara len pri prvom vytvoreni MySQL volume. Riesenie:
  ./vendor/bin/sail down -v
  ./vendor/bin/sail up -d

Docker: "permission denied while trying to connect to the Docker daemon socket":
  pouzivatel nie je v skupine docker - pozri krok 0 (usermod -aG docker, potom newgrp docker).
